                                jcr:lastModified="{Date}2024-09-04T05:41:07.093-04:00"
                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="kaspatx"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                text="&lt;p>&lt;span class=&quot;body-unica-20-reg&quot;>Patrick has been with AbbVie since 2010. He started as Medical Manager and progressed to Head Medical Affairs Immunology. He later switched to the commercial side as Business Unit Manager Dermatology and Gastroenterology. After a stint as Commercial Director Dermatology in the European branch of AbbVie, he returned to Switzerland and took over the commercial management of Immunology. In September 2024 he changed the department and was named Buissness Unit Director Oncology.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;span class=&quot;body-unica-20-reg&quot;>Prior to joining AbbVie, Patrick worked in therapeutic antibody development at a UK company and in the European Medical Affairs department of an international pharmaceutical company. Patrick holds a doctorate in natural sciences from the ETH Zurich, a Master's degree in biotechnology and an MBA from the Universities of Rochester and Bern.&lt;/span>&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                textIsRich="true"/>
                            <button
                                cq:styleIds="[1659997777274]"
                                jcr:created="{Date}2022-12-02T16:28:04.724-05:00"
                                jcr:createdBy="chiucx"
                                jcr:lastModified="{Date}2024-03-29T17:00:03.987-04:00"
                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="jewitca"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                jcr:title="LinkedIn Profile"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/button/v2/button"
                                accessibilityLabel="LinkedIn profile"
                                linkTarget="_blank"
                                linkURL="https://www.linkedin.com/in/patrickdufner/"/>
                        </par_14>
                        <text_copy
                            cq:styleIds="[1659545825678]"
                            jcr:created="{Date}2022-11-29T15:27:16.203-05:00"
                            jcr:createdBy="chiucx"
                            jcr:lastModified="{Date}2024-03-15T14:02:54.273-04:00"
                            jcr:lastModifiedBy="jewitca"
                            jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                            sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                            text="&lt;p>&lt;span class=&quot;body-unica-20-reg&quot;>Linn kam 2017 als General Manager Schweden zu AbbVie und übernahm 2019&amp;nbsp;ausserdem die Leitung der neu geschaffenen skandinavischen Tochtergesellschaft (Dänemark, Norwegen und Schweden). Zuvor war Linn vier Jahre lang als Country Managerin für ein internationales Pharmaunternehmen in Schweden tätig, nachdem sie 17&amp;nbsp;Jahre lang Berufserfahrung in verschiedenen kaufmännischen Funktionen in unterschiedlichen Therapiebereichen und mit Verantwortung für den gesamten nordischen Raum sammeln konnte.&lt;/span>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;span class=&quot;body-unica-20-reg&quot;>Linn hat 1995 einen Master of Science in Pharmazie an der Universität Uppsala erworben.&lt;/span>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                            textIsRich="true"/>
